<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN WATER COMPANY TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</title>
<headline>TALLINN WATER COMPANY TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn water and sewage company will issue 40 million kroons in three-month commercial papers on July 8, Hansapank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Commercial papers have a yield of seven percent, the interest products manager with the bank, Ulo Kallas, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
